{"t":"2026-10-26T11:43:10.392Z","elapsed_s":806.515,"kind":"stop","op":"log","input":null,"reaction":"I am stopping here. I opened Feedback and pressed I am stopping; it showed as pressed. I typed nothing and did not press Submit. This visit was kinder than the last one: I could help with the rent, I could see his likely answer, and he called Selin on the first night. But once Rıza said Hacer’s words back to me, I lost the feeling that these are people. I understood everything, and there was nothing new waiting for me.","game_clock":"Ramadan 2 19:35","engagement":null,"reason":"BORED","op_ms":0,"error":null,"requested_control_present_before":null}
